    "name": "DOQ Server API",
    "description": "Postman collection for the DOQ Server FastAPI application.\n\nBase URL: http://localhost:9571\n\nActual route prefixes in code: /api/basic, /api/session, /api/archive\nWebSocket endpoint: /api/session/chat?sid={{sid}} (use a separate Postman WebSocket request)",
